<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Reducing the Probability of Undesirable Outputs in Language Models Using Probabilistic Inference</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Stephen Zhao
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
